  "notes": [
    "**Mejorar** is a regular **-AR verb**",
    "No spelling changes or stem changes",
    "Can be transitive (to improve something) or intransitive (to get better)",
    "Often used reflexively: **mejorarse** (to get better - health)",
    "Common usage: *mejorar la situación* (to improve the situation), *mejorarse de una enfermedad* (to recover from an illness)",
    "Related adjective: **mejor** (better), **el/la mejor** (the best)",
    "Opposite: **empeorar** (to worsen, to get worse)",
    "Common expression: *¡Que te mejores!* (Get well soon!)"
  ],
